LECTRICAL SYSTEM","summary":"Chrysler Group, LLC (Chrysler) is recalling certain model year 2010-2014 Chrysler Town and Country and Dodge Grand Caravan vehicles manufactured August 25, 2010, through October 31, 2013.  The affected vehicles may experience overheating of the vent window switch in the driver's door armrest.","consequence":"An overheated switch may result in a vehicle fire.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will replace the vent window switch with a newer version, free of charge.  The owner notification letter was issued and the remedy campaign launched on on December 31, 2014.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is P25.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":644757,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=14V234000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":10,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2010","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"11V315000","received":"2011-06-08","manufacturer":"CHRYSLER GROUP LLC","component":"STEERING:COLUMN","summary":"CHRYSLER IS RECALLING CERTAIN MODEL YEAR 2011DODGE JOURNEY, JEEP WRANGLER, CHRYSLER 200, CHRYSLER 200 CONVERTIBLE, DODGE AVENGER, DODGE NITRO, JEEP LIBERTY, DODGE CALIBER, JEEP COMPASS, JEEP PATRIOT, DODGE GRAND CARAVAN AND CHRYSLER TOWN & COUNTRY VEHICLES.  SOME OF THESE VEHICLES MAY HAVE BEEN BUILT WITH A MISSING OR INCORRECTLY INSTALLED STEERING COLUMN PIVOT RIVET.","consequence":"A MISSING OR INCORRECTLY INSTALLED RIVET COULD COMPROMISE THE ABILITY OF THE STEERING COLUMN TO SUPPORT THE OCCUPANT LOADS IN THE EVENT OF A FRONTAL CRASH, DECREASING THE EFFECTIVENESS OF THE FRONTAL IMPACT SAFETY SYSTEM.  AS A RESULT, THE CONDITION MAY INCREASE THE POTENTIAL FOR INJURY IN A FRONTAL CRASH.","remedy":"DEALERS WILL INSPECT FOR RIVET PRESENCE AND ALIGNMENT AND REPAIR THE STEERING COLUMN PIVOT AS REQUIRED, FREE OF CHARGE.  THE SAFETY RECALL BEGAN ON JULY 4, 2011.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT CHRYSLER AT 1-800-853-1403.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":11096,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=11V315000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":12,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"LIBERTY"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"NITRO"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200 CONVERTIBLE"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"JOURNEY"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"WRANGLER"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"CALIBER"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"25V876000","received":"2025-12-18","manufacturer":"Rollx Vans","component":"EQUIPMENT ADAPTIVE/MOBILITY:WHEELCHAIR RESTRAINTS/SECUREMENT:LATCH/ANCHOR:","summary":"Rollx Vans (Rollx) is recalling certain GMC Yukon, Sierra, Chevrolet Express 2500, Ford Transit, E-250, Toyota Sienna, Sienna Hybrid, Honda Odyssey, Chrysler Town and Country, Voyager, Pacifica, Dodge Grand Caravan, and Ram Promaster vehicles equipped with QRT-Deluxe and QRT-Max wheelchair restraints. Please refer to Rollx's recall report for specific model year information. The retractors may not lock, preventing the wheelchair from being properly secured.","consequence":"An unsecured wheelchair can move during transit, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Rollx will work with Q'Straint to inspect and replace the retractors as necessary, free of charge. Owner notification letters were mailed February 5, 2026. Owners may contact Rollx's customer service at 1-800-956-6668.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":86,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=25V876000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":52,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2024","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2023","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2024","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2024","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2024","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2025","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA HYBRID"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2025","make":"RAM","model":"PROMASTER"},{"year":"2025","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"VOYAGER"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"YUKON"},{"year":"2025","make":"GMC","model":"SIERRA 1500"},{"year":"2025","make":"FORD","model":"TRANSIT"},{"year":"2021","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"PACIFICA"},{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year